uncing on bubbles and avoid the hazards which slowly present themselves. Glowing red = danger... at least to start with! Each new depth you reach causes the colours to change and the hazards to increase, with enough random generation so each upfall is never the same. It's not easy, it's sometimes mean, but with fast restarts, lots to discover, and quick rounds you'll find yourself coming back over and over.\n\nCan you find your way back to the surface?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/upfall", "videos": [{"id": 151606, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "pNU2b42XLdY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pNU2b42XLdY", "title": "Upfall - Launching for free: 19th May", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pNU2b42XLdY/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}